## Step 3 — Upload the CSV to the Jumpbox

SSH into the jumpbox and place the CSV in the pending directory:

```bash
scp migration_request_20260611_103701.csv lmrg34ja:/data/MRGeng/Migration_Utility/pending/
```

Or if you are already on the jumpbox, copy it directly:

```bash
cp /tmp/migration_request_20260611_103701.csv /data/MRGeng/Migration_Utility/pending/
```

Confirm it is there before launching the job:

```bash
ls -ltr /data/MRGeng/Migration_Utility/pending/
```

