## Step 6 — Launch Live Run

Once the dry run output looks correct, go back to the job template, set **Dry run = false**, and launch again.

The live output follows the same format. Each row will show `[EXEC]` and then `[OK]` or `[FAIL]`:

```
ROW 1 — DATA_TRANSFER
  Source      : rhel8-app01.dc1.corp:/app/data/jdoe/reports
  Destination : rhel9-app01.dc2.corp:/var/app/data/reports
  User remap  : jdoe -> CORP\ad_jdoe
  Group remap : appgrp -> CORP\ad_appgrp
[EXEC] rsync -avz --chown=CORP\\ad_jdoe:CORP\\ad_appgrp rhel8-app01.dc1.corp:/app/data/jdoe/reports rhel9-app01.dc2.corp:/var/app/data/reports
[OK]   exit 0 (3.2s)
```

