## Directory Structure Reference

```
/data/MRGeng/Migration_Utility/
├── migration_runner.sh          ← the script (do not edit)
├── pending/                     ← drop CSV here before running
├── processed/                   ← CSV moves here on full success
├── failed/                      ← CSV moves here on any skip or failure
└── logs/
    ├── migration_request_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.run.log
    └── migration_request_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.rsync.log
```

